# Claude Code / Cursor rules for ord-api

Agent behavior (precedence, communication, git): **`docs/ai-rules/concept/agent-behavior.md`**

## Git

- Do **not** run `git commit` on your own. When a batch of work is ready, summarize what
  changed and ask the user for explicit approval.
- After the user approves, commit, then **push to the remote immediately**.

Technical git rules: `docs/ai-rules/git-workflow/`.
